<title>GERMANY: German traders seek no intervention grain exports.</title>
<headline>German traders seek no intervention grain exports.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>German state intervention board BLE received no bids from traders on Thursday for the export of intervention grain to third countries, a BLE spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The bids would have been collected and submitted to the weekly European Union cereals management meeting.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
